  "summary": "Results-oriented Software Engineer with 10+ years of experience building AI-driven developer tools, internal platforms, and automation systems at scale. I specialize in integrating large language models (LLMs), streamlining engineering workflows, and delivering secure, high-impact solutions across cross-functional teams.\n\n- AI/LLM Integration\n- Developer Tooling\n- Full-Stack Engineering\n- Workflow Automation\n- Cross-Team Enablement\n- AI/ML Community Leadership\n- Open Source Contributor\n\nDriven by impact and execution, I deliver practical AI solutions that reduce manual effort, improve developer experience, and scale across large organizations. I thrive at the intersection of infrastructure, intelligence, and internal enablement.",
