      "description": "Design, develop, and maintain scalable internal web applications with a growing focus on AI automation, analytics, and software tooling.\n\nLeverage a master's degree in Big Data, AI, and Machine Learning to apply cutting-edge techniques across internal platforms and engineering workflows.\n\nProactively explore and integrate open-source technologies to enhance productivity for both internal engineering teams and external customers.\n\nKey Achievements:\n• Created and deployed the MPLAB AI Coding Assistant, an AI assistant built by adapting the Continue.dev VSCode plugin—boosting engineering productivity and contributing to a 10% rise in Microchip’s stock price.\n• Developed machine learning tools to extract insights from JIRA data, including automated word clouds and topic modeling using large language models to surface recurring issue patterns.\n• Drove company-wide AI enablement by supporting internal teams with solution design, tooling selection, and exploratory AI initiatives.\n• Co-developed a web application to standardize semiconductor lifecycle tracking, enabling advanced analytics on process efficiency, bottlenecks, and resource spend.",
      "insights": ""
     },
     {
      "title": "Software Engineer I",
      "locationName": "Chandler, Arizona",
