      "totalDuration": "5 yrs 4 mos",
      "description": "Developed web, database, and automation solutions using both established and emerging technologies. Supported multi-site global engineering teams by resolving network issues and enhancing cross-site communication.\n\nApplied computer science and electrical engineering principles across the full software development lifecycle, from design and documentation to implementation, testing, and executive presentations.\n\nDelivered and maintained global software tools used across all Microchip facilities.\n\nKey Achievements:\n• Reduced designers’ tracking time by 50% by replacing manual Excel workflows with a custom CRUD web app (HTML, CSS, jQuery, etc.).\n• Cut error tracking effort by 80% by integrating JIRA into the workflow.\n• Boosted tracking efficiency by 100% using automation via REST APIs, MongoDB, ExpressJS, and NodeJS.\n• Replaced legacy Perl scripts with modular Python tools to improve simulation reliability.\n• Reduced downtime and rework by developing a global code versioning system to sync code revisions across sites.\n• Shortened full-chip simulation time by ~90% through rigorous testing and optimization with updated software tools.",
